d with erotic elements and adventure, where you control Evelina, a sweet and shy journalism student. She visits a dark mansion to interview a mysterious elderly man, unaware of the terrifying encounters awaiting her.<br />\n<br />\nPLEASE NOTE: This is an early, rough demo version. Expect to encounter bugs, unfinished content, and limited gameplay. This demo provides a taste of the atmosphere and core gameplay mechanics.<br />\n<br />\nWe will actively continue developing the game, adding more content, exciting new mechanics, characters, and significantly enhancing graphics and animations based on your feedback and support."}]}, {"type": "image", "title": "Main Character", "body": [{"intro": "Meet Evelina, a charming, somewhat shy 21-year-old student with a captivating presence and innocent curiosity, often leading her into unexpected and thrilling situations.", "image_info": {"url": "//img.dlsite.jp/modpub/images2/parts/RJ01428000/RJ01427930/60429a3275302c913ec4b14392e3425c.jpg", "alt": "Evelina’s Dark Report [Abstractum]", "title": "Evelina’s Dark Report [Abstractum]"}, "position": "over"}]}, {"type": "image", "title": "Gameplay Atmosphere", "body": [{"intro": "Immerse yourself in realistic graphics and a gripping atmosphere of suspense and horror. Explore dark environments, use your flashlight, find hidden paths and keys, and evade menacing creatures, each representing a different human vice or dark side.", "image_info": {"url": "//img.dlsite.jp/modpub/images2/parts/RJ01428000/RJ01427930/8d70081085daf0b3e47b443edc5dc58b.jpg", "alt": "Evelina’s Dark Report [Abstractum]", "title": "Evelina’s Dark Report [Abstractum]"}, "position": "over"}]}, {"type": "image", "title": "Erotic Content", "body": [{"intro": "The demo version includes several explicit scenes:<br />\r\n • Evelina in the shower.<br />\r\n • Encounter with a wolf.<br />\r\n • Interaction with puppets.<br />\r\n • Ghost in the mansion.", "image_info": {"url": "//img.dlsite.jp/modpub/images2/parts/RJ01428000/RJ01427930/68d251f060a05dd445c285e94745b577.jpg", "alt": "Evelina’s Dark Report [Abstractum]", "title": "Evelina’s Dark Report [Abstractum]"}, "position": "over"}]}, {"type": "text", "title": "Future Development &amp; Feedback", "body": [{"intro": "Your feedback is extremely valuable! Every suggestion, comment, or constructive criticism will be considered as we continue to develop the game. Our main goal is to enhance the game quality steadily and regularly provide engaging updates.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWe hope this project will grow into a memorable experience for fans of the genre, evolving steadily with your support and ideas"}]}, {"type": "text", "title": "About AI-Generated Content", "body": [{"intro": "This game uses partial AI-generated content for development assistance.  <br />\nSpecifically:  <br />\n– Voice lines were generated using ElevenLabs AI for dialogue scenes.  <br />\n– No AI-generated images or animations are used.  <br />\n– All characters, story, and visual design were created by humans.  <br />\nWe disclose this to maintain transparency with our audience."}]}], "description": "dark 3D erotic horror adventure featuring monsters, mystery, and pleasure", "short_introduction": "dark 3D erotic horror adventure featuring monsters, mystery, and pleasure", "url": "https://www.dlsite.com/maniax/work/=/product_id/RJ01427930.html", "site_id": "maniax", "fetched_at": 1794947976}